   _Entry.Related_coordinate_file_name   .
   _Entry.Details
;
Entry contains assignments of backbone amides as well as of the isopeptide bond 
formed between residue K63 of the proximal ubiquitin and the C-terminal G76 of 
the distal ubiquitin, in K63-linked di-ubiquitin. 
The K63R mutation in the distal ubiquitin was introduced to enable controlled 
enzymatic assembly of K63-linked di-ubiquitin.
;
   _Entry.BMRB_internal_directory_name   .

